# Local releases belong in GitHub Releases, not Git history.
/release/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/build/
**/*.spec
**/.scsp-cache/
**/web-downloads/
**/wardrobe-thumbnails/
**/model-previews/
**/image-previews/
**/motion-previews/
**/audio-previews/
**/audio-index/
**/updates/
**/history/
**/docs/
**/*.log
**/.update.lock
**/official-current-index.json
**/latest-index.json
**/song-names.json
**/character-data.json
**/wardrobe-data.json
**/update-report.json
**/song-names-source/
**/character-data-source/
# Runtime files are copied from a Release. Retain integration source and licenses.
source/tools/**
!source/tools/**/
!source/tools/**/*.cs
!source/tools/**/LICENSE
!source/tools/**/COPYING
!source/tools/**/SOURCE.md
source/research/**/Library/
source/research/**/Temp/
source/research/**/Logs/
source/research/**/UserSettings/
source/research/**/obj/
source/research/**/PreviewTextures/
source/research/**/Assets/Resources/
